DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42319::$$$message_0333_0000_0000$$$::"Hahaha, this is a cakewalk![lr]::
42320::$$$message_0333_0000_0001$$$::Setting aside why we got attacked for no reason, that was easy-peasy!"::
42321::$$$message_0333_0000_0002$$$::"It felt like they were here to fulfill a personal grudge rather than try for the onsen, but I must have imagined it."::
42322::$$$message_0333_0000_0003$$$::"Ergh."::
42323::$$$message_0333_0001_0000$$$::"I've found you, terrible trio!"::
42324::$$$message_0333_0002_0000$$$::"...! Get back, Yukika!"::
42325::$$$message_0333_0002_0001$$$::"Aaah!"::
42326::$$$message_0333_0003_0000$$$::"...Narrow miss.[lr]::
42327::$$$message_0333_0003_0001$$$::Just a little closer, and you would've gone splat."::
42328::$$$message_0333_0004_0000$$$::"Well, if it isn't the maids I've seen around Emiya's place.[lr]::
42329::$$$message_0333_0004_0001$$$::Are you looking for the onsen, too?"::
42330::$$$message_0333_0004_0002$$$::"...Yeah. We finally got a day off.[lr]::
42331::$$$message_0333_0004_0003$$$::Sella is really looking forward to trying a Japanese onsen."::
42332::$$$message_0333_0004_0004$$$::"Oh? If you two are participating, then the rumor about wishes coming true may not be idle gossip after all..."::
42333::$$$message_0333_0004_0005$$$::"How about this? We don't want to fight you. Why don't we make a deal, as fellow minor characters?"::
42334::$$$message_0333_0004_0006$$$::".........How impudent.[lr]::
42335::$$$message_0333_0004_0007$$$::We don't have the luxury of cooperating with you."::
42336::$$$message_0333_0004_0008$$$::"(Nods)[lr]::
42337::$$$message_0333_0004_0009$$$::Bullies must die. [wvl canskip=0 time=600][hffacechg chara=リズ face=喜 layer=0 time=200][hfpop layer=0]But well done, making Sella cry."::
42338::$$$message_0333_0004_0010$$$::"...Can I have those photo negatives later?"::
42339::$$$message_0333_0004_0011$$$::"Silence, Leysritt!"::
42340::$$$message_0333_0004_0012$$$::"...Enough talk.[lr]::
42341::$$$message_0333_0004_0013$$$::We will win this fight and destroy the evidence. Prepare yourself, Yukika Saegusa!"::
42342::$$$message_0333_0004_0014$$$::"Eh?"::
42343::$$$message_0333_0004_0015$$$::"Mrgh?"::
42344::$$$message_0333_0004_0016$$$::"Um... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Are you pointing at me?"�{hn